<section class="section">
  <div class="container with-aside">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        O.L Services is based in Sacramento and works in homes across the greater
        Sacramento area. We cover the parts of a home that handle fire, smoke and
        exhaust air: chimneys and fireplaces, wood, gas and pellet stoves, dryer
        vents and air ducts.
      </p>
      <p>
        These systems are easy to forget because they sit behind walls, above ceilings
        and up on the roof. When they're neglected, they tend to fail in ways that
        matter: chimney fires, leaks, smoke in the house, or a dryer vent packed with lint.
        Our job is to keep that from happening, and to give you straight answers about
        the condition of your home.
      </p>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <p>
        Every visit follows the same four steps: <strong>inspect, quote, clean or repair,
        report</strong>. You'll know what we found, what it costs and what we did
        before we leave.
      </p>
    </div>
    <aside class="aside">
      <div class="aside-card aside-quote">
        <h2>Talk to us</h2>
        <p>Questions about your chimney, stove or vents? Call for a free quote.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-block" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">
          {% include "partials/icon-phone.njk" %}
          {{ site.phone }}
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-light btn-block" href="/contact/">Request online</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

