        <h3>Look before we quote</h3>
        <p>We don't price a job over the phone without knowing what's going on. We look first, then give you a clear number.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="value">
        <h3>Honest recommendations</h3>
        <p>If something doesn't need doing yet, we'll say so. If an inspection is all you need, that's all we'll recommend.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="value">
        <h3>Show, don't just tell</h3>
        <p>When we find a problem, we show you with photos, video or a look for yourself, so you can decide with real information.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="value">
        <h3>Respect for your home</h3>
